cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "PtmProMPlugin"
abstract: >-
  A ProM plugin for trend deviation detection in event logs, built on top of
  the BeepBeep event stream processing library and its PatTheMiner palette.
  Given an event log in XES format, the plugin detects when traces deviate
  from an expected behavior trend, using configurable trend functions,
  distance metrics, and thresholds accessible through a step-by-step wizard.
